OL,3,GNEWSALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Zack Polanski says he will
OL,8,F"of course" carry on as leader of the
OL,9,FGreens and his party is "more of an
OL,10,Felectoral threat in these seats than
OL,11,Fwe've ever been before"
OL,13,FSpeaking to BBC Breakfast, Polanski
OL,14,Fsays he wouldn't have voted for the
OL,15,Fmotion - passed by Green Party members
OL,16,Flast weekend - in its current form.
OL,17,FHere are the amendments he previously
OL,18,Fcalled for, which were rejected
